Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: bfd/cofflink.c
Line: 3072
Function: coff_relocate_section
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: For C_NT_WEAK symbols with one aux record, the code indexes the sym_hashes array using h->aux->x_sym.x_tagndx.u32 without validating that the index is within bounds. A malformed aux record can set x_tagndx to an out-of-range value, leading to an out-of-bounds read when fetching h2 from sym_hashes.

